<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said on Tuesday analyst Debra Wang Smith had cut her rating for Chilean supermarket chain Santa Isabel SA to long-term buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company fell 1/2 to 28 in New York.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk 212 859-1879))</p>
</text>
